  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into wedges.\n• Place on lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e15e7bff1dd159f6ce6/step-703f6e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While fries are baking, thinly slice red onion.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 mins. Reduce heat to medium.\n• Add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water and mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 2-4 mins. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e15e7bff1dd159f6ce6/step-2ee3f610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pat haloumi dry, then slice horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• Wash and dry frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden, 2 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e15e7bff1dd159f6ce6/step-dca24f20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve continental rolls and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• Spread roll bases with dill & parsley mayonnaise. Top with caramelised onions, haloumi and salad leaves.\n• Serve with wedges and your favourite dipping sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e15e7bff1dd159f6ce6/step-68a82a30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
